{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "forty thousand licensed brokers in this city. two hundred thousand sales last year.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000001"}], "text": "There are 40,000 licensed brokers in the city and 200,000 sales last year."}, "title": "Real Estate Market Context", "topic": "Real Estate Context"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:d1520f1190caf683", "metadata_hash": "0095005081373111196ff1a1bf327770e7f4f9b6d324227680de219556550150", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Real Estate Market Context", "topic": "Real Estate Context", "topic_slug": "real-estate-context"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000004"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Then you walked into the commission only business, which is not a job. It's a company with one employee and nobody ranks anything for you anymore.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000004"}], "text": "Being in a commission-only business is like running a company with one employee, and priorities don't come from the calendar."}, "title": "Understanding Commission-Only Business", "topic": "Commission-Only Business"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:7f4ae448b0246887", "metadata_hash": "0095005081373111196ff1a1bf327770e7f4f9b6d324227680de219556550150", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Understanding Commission-Only Business", "topic": "Commission-Only Business", "topic_slug": "commission-only-business"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000011", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000012"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Then the part that turns all of that into confidence.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010"}], "text": "To enhance confidence and knowledge in new real estate agents through structured content creation activities."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [{"citations": [{"quote": "First of all, map of the city where the public transfer is going in the next five years. The top ten developers in the history, their stock, and what happened to the project they already handed over.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010"}], "text": "Knowledge of the city’s future public transport development and past projects of top developers."}], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Every week you build two presentations. Each one compares either free project or free locations.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010"}], "text": "Create two presentations weekly that compare three projects or locations."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "You write the slides, you write the speaker notes, then you record yourself exactly like this, delivering that.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010"}], "text": "Write slides and speaker notes, then record yourself delivering the presentation."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Then the part that turns all of that into confidence. Every week you build two presentations. Each one compares either free project or free locations.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010"}, {"quote": "You studied three projects. You build the slides, you practice it loud, loud. That is content. You just have to point camera edit.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000012"}], "text": "New real estate agents should focus on generating content based on their research and knowledge acquisition."}, "title": "Content Generation for New Agents", "topic": "Content Generation"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:b7c65145bb996fb9", "metadata_hash": "0095005081373111196ff1a1bf327770e7f4f9b6d324227680de219556550150", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Content Generation for New Agents", "topic": "Content Generation", "topic_slug": "content-generation"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000009", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000010", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000011", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000012", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000013", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000014", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000015", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000016", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000017", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000018", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000019", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000020", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000021"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "If you under six months in, your day should not look like a top producer in your team.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000009"}], "text": "A new agent's day should focus more on education and market knowledge rather than following a top producer's schedule."}, "title": "Time Management for New Agents", "topic": "Time Management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:aec877cba9318dab", "metadata_hash": "0095005081373111196ff1a1bf327770e7f4f9b6d324227680de219556550150", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Time Management for New Agents", "topic": "Time Management", "topic_slug": "time-management"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Now you're looking at your week, telling me there is no room for eight blocks, and you're right. There isn't.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000022"}], "text": "Agents might not have space for eight blocks due to poor scheduling order."}], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000018", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000019", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000020", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000021", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000022", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000023"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Your money making activities become the priority.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000018"}], "text": "To increase lead generation and potential sales through structured cold calling."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [{"citations": [{"quote": "And I know what you're about to tell me. Olga, that's not possible. The agents who come to me are doing twenty dials a day.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000020"}], "text": "Availability of leads or a list of contacts to call."}], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "It's two blocks a day, forty-five minutes each. Eight blocks in your week.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000020"}], "text": "Schedule two calling blocks every day, each lasting forty-five minutes."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Everything off. Your portal, your WhatsApp, your notifications, phones face down, except the one you are dialing with.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000021"}], "text": "Ensure total concentration during calls: turn off all distractions, use a timer, and manually note down call details."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "A money making activity is when you're talking to a stranger who could potentially buy something from you.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000018"}, {"quote": "It's two blocks a day, forty-five minutes each. Eight blocks in your week.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000020"}], "text": "Agents should efficiently manage their cold calling schedule to maximize sales and lead generation."}, "title": "Effective Cold Calling", "topic": "Cold Calling"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:036897952d45a7c2", "metadata_hash": "0095005081373111196ff1a1bf327770e7f4f9b6d324227680de219556550150", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Effective Cold Calling", "topic": "Cold Calling", "topic_slug": "cold-calling"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000022", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000023"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "I can tell you the mistake in three seconds. You build it forward.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000022"}], "text": "To ensure critical business tasks are given priority in scheduling."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "The operation goes into the calendar first and everything else is arranged around it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000023"}], "text": "Schedule essential tasks before other meetings and calls."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "do what a surgeon does. The operation goes into the calendar first and everything else is arranged around it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000023"}], "text": "Tasks should be prioritized like a surgeon's schedule, ensuring critical tasks are scheduled first."}, "title": "Time Allocation and Task Prioritization", "topic": "Time Management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:d20aaf5f92137d3b", "metadata_hash": "0095005081373111196ff1a1bf327770e7f4f9b6d324227680de219556550150", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Time Allocation and Task Prioritization", "topic": "Time Management", "topic_slug": "time-management"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000013", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000014"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Sales skills. And it's not about watching, it's about practicing.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000013"}], "text": "Improve sales skills through targeted practice and engagement strategy."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Find the body, one plays the agent, one plays the client, and you run the real conversation.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000013"}], "text": "Role-play conversations to simulate real client interactions."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Find the body, one plays the agent, one plays the client, and you run the real conversation.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000013"}], "text": "Engage with potential clients through practice and role-playing of sales conversations."}, "title": "Client Engagement Strategy", "topic": "Client Engagement"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:b615d5ac094419d8", "metadata_hash": "0095005081373111196ff1a1bf327770e7f4f9b6d324227680de219556550150", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Client Engagement Strategy", "topic": "Client Engagement", "topic_slug": "client-engagement"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000016", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000017"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "you have to analyze the week you had and set the priority for the week ahead. It's not about the five days you keep planning.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000016"}], "text": "Agents should review their week and set priorities for the upcoming week, usually on Saturday afternoons."}, "title": "Weekly Review and Planning", "topic": "Time Management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:knowledge:8eb80bcfcca8845f", "metadata_hash": "0095005081373111196ff1a1bf327770e7f4f9b6d324227680de219556550150", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-30", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "fc3c6d9995a89fdad098e239e283f8b9398564ffea17430a1b1ba8b08e580c51", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LT8S6d8aeYY", "title": "Weekly Review and Planning", "topic": "Time Management", "topic_slug": "time-management"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000022", "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000023"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "Now you're looking at your week, telling me there is no room for eight blocks, and you're right.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000022"}], "text": "Agent's schedule shows no room for essential task blocks."}, "diagnosis": {"citations": [{"quote": "I can tell you the mistake in three seconds. You build it forward.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000022"}], "text": "The agent builds the schedule forward, filling it with tasks in the order they arrive."}, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Now you're looking at your week, telling me there is no room for eight blocks, and you're right.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000022"}], "text": "The agent's week appears full and poorly organized."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": {"citations": [{"quote": "do what a surgeon does. The operation goes into the calendar first and everything else is arranged around it.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for-real-estate-agents-hour-by-hour-schedule-e4701583b6:u000023"}], "text": "Schedule key tasks as a priority, like a surgeon's critical operations."}, "title": "Agent Time Management Illustration", "topic": "Time Management"}, "content_hash": "74e7ce9cb8a78b230b9b4be93c2d5e67f1242813167df0d59453d8d48fa8444d", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-30-time-management-for